    "name": "The Last Good Boy",
    "steam_appid": 3524950,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524950/extras/86f597b6f37afd0d7c4ddd13905fb236.poster.avif?t=1754683050\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524950/extras/86f597b6f37afd0d7c4ddd13905fb236.webm?t=1754683050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have you ever wondered how similar our dog's life is to that of an RPG game? Well, I did.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is inspired by my real-life dog, <strong>Ramon</strong>. He\u2019s a small Shih Tzu with a big imagination! He loves playing with his toys\u2014uh, I mean, weapons. Sometimes, he enjoys fetching ranged weapons (like a good ol\u2019 ball); other times, he prefers melee combat with sticks and bones. Oh, and he even has some stylish outfits\u2014oops, I mean armor\u2014to keep him safe from the harsh environment!<strong>\u00a0</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524950/extras/19c3b4258a985f8ce3c20b2d0eb91a89.avif?t=1754683050\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524950/extras/6dc524e7ac76e4945bc4286b9bc2d50e.poster.avif?t=1754683050\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524950/extras/6dc524e7ac76e4945bc4286b9bc2d50e.apng?t=1754683050\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524950/extras/f017a8da2044c97b05d055e2a0ace6b1.poster.avif?t=1754683050\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524950/extras/f017a8da2044c97b05d055e2a0ace6b1.webm?t=1754683050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524950/extras/86f597b6f37afd0d7c4ddd13905fb236.poster.avif?t=1754683050\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524950/extras/86f597b6f37afd0d7c4ddd13905fb236.webm?t=1754683050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have you ever wondered how similar our dog's life is to that of an RPG game? Well, I did.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is inspired by my real-life dog, <strong>Ramon</strong>. He\u2019s a small Shih Tzu with a big imagination! He loves playing with his toys\u2014uh, I mean, weapons. Sometimes, he enjoys fetching ranged weapons (like a good ol\u2019 ball); other times, he prefers melee combat with sticks and bones. Oh, and he even has some stylish outfits\u2014oops, I mean armor\u2014to keep him safe from the harsh environment!<strong>\u00a0</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524950/extras/19c3b4258a985f8ce3c20b2d0eb91a89.avif?t=1754683050\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524950/extras/6dc524e7ac76e4945bc4286b9bc2d50e.poster.avif?t=1754683050\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524950/extras/6dc524e7ac76e4945bc4286b9bc2d50e.apng?t=1754683050\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524950/extras/f017a8da2044c97b05d055e2a0ace6b1.poster.avif?t=1754683050\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524950/extras/f017a8da2044c97b05d055e2a0ace6b1.webm?t=1754683050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Who is a good boy? Yes, he is! Guide Ramon in his quest to uncover where the other good boys have gone. In this charming Incremental idle adventure, battle monsters, gather resources, and craft powerful gear to explore new lands. Help Ramon become the ultimate good boy!",
